{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35816","headline":"湘浦有怀 · 李咸用","name":"湘浦有怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸿雁哀哀背朔方，余霞倒影画潇湘。\n长汀细草愁春浪，古渡寒花倚夕阳。\n鬼树夜分千炬火，渔舟朝巷一蓬霜。\n侬家本是持竿者，爲爱明时入帝乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35816.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35816","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}